OL,3,GNEWSADamage being assessed after
OL,4,A'significant' Killarney flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 57mm of rain fell in a four-hour
OL,7,Fperiod during flash floods in a town in
OL,8,FCounty Kerry and the fire service
OL,9,Fdeployed pumps to clear one road of
OL,10,Fsurface water.
OL,12,FKerry County Council crews are
OL,13,Fassessing the impact of the flooding in
OL,14,FKillarney on Thursday evening.
OL,16,FCouncil staff, the Kerry Fire Service
OL,17,Fand the Kerry Civil Defence attended
OL,18,Fthe scene at about 19:00 local time.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
