OL,3,GNEWSADamage being assessed after
OL,4,A'significant' Killarney flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said some 30mm of rain fell
OL,7,Fin one hour alone, and this caused very
OL,8,F"significant flooding on roads
OL,9,Fthroughout the town," with many roads
OL,10,Fimpassable for a time.
